# PDFs are excluded because their contents cannot be reviewed at commit time, and several are
# rendered from the .md sources tracked alongside them. SME_Review.pdf in particular is believed
# to embed the per-bridge backtest table, which is deliberately not published (see below).
*.pdf

# --- SME review: aggregate exhibits are tracked, per-bridge outputs are not -------------------
# The exhibits below are aggregates (per starting rating, per material, per feature) carrying no
# bridge identifiers, so they can travel with the code -- the validation appendix rendered by
# forecast_ui.py and the numbers quoted in the reports are built from exactly these files.
# sample_forecasts_backtest.csv and the district watch-lists are excluded instead: they list
# individual structures by NBI code, which is an internal analytical product rather than
# something to publish from a public repository.
sme_review/*
!sme_review/SME_Review_Packet.md
!sme_review/accuracy_by_starting_rating.csv
!sme_review/benchmark_vs_markov.csv
!sme_review/deterioration_by_material.csv
!sme_review/feature_importance.csv
!sme_review/scatter_sample.csv

# generated district reports (large, regenerate with build_district_reports.py)
reports/
